# Backend

This backend is built with Java and Spring Boot for the bank appointment booking system.

## Setup

```bash
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run
```

The API runs at http://localhost:8080.

## Environment variables

```bash
export DB_HOST=localhost
export DB_PORT=3306
export DB_NAME=bank_appointment_db
export DB_USERNAME=your_db_user
export DB_PASSWORD=your_db_password
```
